# .docpairs — the doc-pairing gate's map (mechanical half only).
#
# A pull request that touches a path matching a glob on the left MUST also
# touch the doc on the right, or the docpairs check fails. This proves the
# doc was TOUCHED, not that it is true — content truth is a review question.
#
# Format: one pairing per line, "<glob> -> <doc path>". Globs support exact
# paths, single-star segments, and a trailing "/**" prefix match.

pkg/httpapi/**  -> docs/api.md
Taskfile.yml    -> docs/operations.md
config/**       -> docs/operations.md
